{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I'm guessing you like men that are a little older?": "",
  "Hmm, do I...?": "",
  "So you do like older guys.": "",
  "I like men who can do their job. So I guess I see that more in older guys.": "",
  "Then what about me? I'm older than you.": "",
  "I'm six years older than you, so I guess I have a chance too.": "",
  "I'm sure that question violates the rules of our game in some way, so I can't answer it!": "",
  "You won't even give me a hint? Dang.": "",
  "Guess I'm up next.": "",
  "You've done at least one job you'd rather not tell anybody.": "",
  "...You mean a job I'm not exactly proud of?": "",
  "Oh? You actually have?": "",
  "Well, it was something I couldn't tell my parents about.": "",
  "What was it?": "",
  "It wasn't sexual or anything like that...": "",
  "But I was pretty much a stand-in hostess for one of my friends that got sick at the time.": "",
  "Mm. I can see how you wouldn't want to tell your parents.": "",
  "What about you? Have you ever done a job you'd rather keep a secret?": "",
  "Aha, so you have.": "",
  "(The fake stakeout I did with Nanami-san the other day is exactly that...)": "",
  "What kind of job was it?": "",
  "Can't say. My profession requires me to keep things confidential.": "",
  "I see... That's kind of a bummer.": "",
  "It's my turn to guess.": "",
  "Gee, thanks...": "",
  "But you're right. I rarely cook for myself since I'm always at work.": "",
  "I doubt I could make anything even close to edible...": "",
  "Hah, well I'd certainly advise against it. Even a day-old bento at the bottom of the shelf would be a better choice.": "",
  "Nonsense. The most important thing about home-cooked food is who made it. And since it's you, I consider it gourmet.": "",
  "Yagami-san... You are too good at compliments, you know that?": "",
  "I'm actually not much of a cook either. I end up going out instead of eating at home.": "",
  "That sure gets expensive after a while...": "",
  "Okay, my turn to guess.": "",
  "You regret quitting your job as a lawyer.": "",
  "...Actually, I don't regret it at all.": "",
  "Not even a tiny bit?": "",
  "Nope. Detective work suits me much better.": "",
  "Interesting. Especially coming from someone with enough brains and talent to pass the bar exam.": "",
  "You really do carve your own path, don't you?": "",
  "Yeah, I suppose I do. Guess I'm up now.": "",
  "H-Hold on... I don't think I can drink... any more.": "",
  "Did the alcohol finally get to you?": "",
  "...Yes. I feel like going any further would be... dangerous.": "",
  "I'm slightly curious as to what you mean by that, but I'd rather let this end on a high note. So let's stop for today.": "",
  "Thank you, Yagami-san... You really are a nice guy.": "",
  "...You know what?": "",
  "I think I'm good. Sorry to call it quits all of a sudden.": "",
  "Oh? Then that means I won!": "",
  "You really can hold your liquor, Nanami-san.": "",
  "Hehe. Didn't I tell you I could?": "",
  "I want to ask you one thing, though.": "",
  "If you were to start looking for a boyfriend, would you give me a chance?": "",
  "You're... asking if you're boyfriend material?": "",
  "...You know I already found the love of my life, don't you? I've been head over heels for a long time now.": "",
  "I'm talking about work, Yagami-san. I've said this multiple times.": "",
  "So I'm leaving it at that!": "",
  "(Well that's one way of evading the question... Damn.)": "",
  "Hey, I wanted to ask you something seriously...": "",
  "You... really want me to answer that?": "",
  "I certainly respect you as a person. I always enjoy our talks, and I admire your unique perspective on life.": "",
  "So does that mean there's hope for me?": "",
  "I'd say... if there was a situation where I absolutely had to choose a man to be with...": "",
  "Right now, you're the strongest candidate.": "",
  "I suppose I should be happy to hear that.": "",
  "...But that's just hypothetical, okay?": "",
  "Why don't we call it a night?": "",
  "Yeah... let's do that...": "",
  "Something tells me you're a little tipsy.": "",
  "...That's not true!": "",
  "Oh boy. You're not just tipsy—you're sloshed, aren't you?": "",
  "Hehe. Maybe. I really haven't drank this much in a while... or had this much fun.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I still don't feel like going home just yet.": "",
  "You know when you're having the time of your life... and then you realize it's time to go? That's what I'm feeling right now.": "",
  "Yeah. I can definitely relate.": "",
  "Well, it would be nice if we could talk some more, but...": "",
  "I'm getting a little tired.": "",
  "(I guess she would be after all those drinks we had...)": "",
  "Only a little bit, though! We don't have to stop here.": "",
  "Gosh, what am I even saying?": "",
  "Ahh. But seriously, I feel like I could keep going.": "",
  "Mhm. I think we should grab a cocktail somewhere.": "",
  "Aww...": "",
  "Oh, I mean. Uh. I guess we could drink a bit more?": "",
  "Geez, stop with the teasing already.": "",
  "Why don't we hit up another bar? Let's just drink the night away.": "",
  "Hehe, wanna drink till the sun comes up?": "",
  "I trust you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(I really should thank Yukko-san for making all this possible. She's the real reason this is going so well.)": "",
  "Nanami-san, is... everything okay?": "",
  "...I knew I've seen that poster somewhere before.": "",
  "So our \"target\" was actually Yukko this whole time. I assume you knew about this?": "",
  "Of course you did. After all, you were the one investigating her.": "",
  "*sigh* I'm sorry to say this, but yes. I knew.": "",
  "Did you team up with Yukko just to make a fool of me?": "",
  "That wasn't my intention at all. All I wanted to do was get to know you better...": "",
  "...Wait, that was Yukko? Wow, what a coincidence!": "",
  "I don't have to be a detective to know how bad of a liar you are.": "",
  "...I'm sorry. I don't know what came over me just now.": "",
  "Are you trying to make a fool of me?": "",
  "That's not my intention at all. All I wanted to do was get to know you better...": "",
  "...But why? What made you feel the need to make up such an elaborate lie?": "",
  "It's kind of complicated, but basically I just wanted to get your attention. I didn't mean for it to turn out this way.": "",
  "So you're saying you're not above deceit and manipulation to get what you want? You make me sick.": "",
  "Nanami, that's not what I...": "",
  "I trusted you. And you betrayed that trust.": "",
  "...I'm sorry.": "",
  "(Uh-oh, here it comes...)": "",
  "That's why I opened up to you! I mean... I showed you the deepest part of my heart...": "",
  "And I respect that, Nanami-san... But—": "",
  "Save your excuses for some other naive girl—I'm done with you. Have a nice life, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Detective</font_kind>.": "",
  "(Damn... What the hell just happened?)": "",
  "She's gone... Shit, was I too late!?": "",
  "Yagami-san!?": "",
  "*pant* What's...": "",
  "*pant* ...What's going on?": "",
  "Nanami-san! Quick, where's the attacker!?": "",
  "What do you mean? Weren't you the one being attacked? I heard you were injured and couldn't even move...": "",
  "You did call the cops, didn't you?": "",
  "No... There must be some mistake.": "",
  "I heard you were being kidnapped. That's why I came running for you.": "",
  "Wait a minute...": "",
  "...Don't tell me...": "",
  "Did Yukko trick us both?": "",
  "That girl... I can't believe she did this <font_kind=yakuza_italic>again</font_kind>!": "",
  "Wait just a moment! Please...": "",
  "I wanted to apologize to you face-to-face.": "",
  "I'm sorry for what I did.": "",
  "Honestly... I don't even care anymore.": "",
  "Are you sure? Because I don't want our relationship to end this way.": "",
  "Then let me ask you something...": "",
  "Why would you betray my trust like that?": "",
  "I poured out my heart to you, gave you the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>one</font_kind> chance I'd never give anyone else, and what did you do?": "",
  "...Well, I—": "",
  "You played it off like it was one of your little <font_kind=yakuza_italic>side cases</font_kind>!": "",
  "...I know. And I apologize.": "",
  "Stop apologizing and just tell me what you're really after!": "",
  "What I'm really after... is you, Nanami-san.": "",
  "All I've ever wanted to do was get to know you better. To have a good time together and share some beautiful memories.": "",
  "That's the only reason I did such an idiotic thing.": "",
  "This isn't another trick you're playing on me, is it?": "",
  "Of course not. Please believe me when I say I'm telling the truth.": "",
  "But... how can I? After all that's happened?": "",
  "Actually, I'm not too sure myself.": "",
  "Wh-What kind of answer is that!?": "",
  "All I know for sure is how much I want to get to know you. To spend time with you and share some beautiful memories.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I...": "",
  "...I'm sorry. I need time to sort things out.": "",
  "If you walk away from here, I'm assuming this is the last time we'll see each other. Right?": "",
  "Maybe it will be the last time we see each other. I can't really say for sure.": "",
  "Then... what can I do to change your mind?": "",
  "How about letting go of me, for starters?": "",
  "...Just let me ask you one last thing.": "",
  "How do you really feel about me, Nanami-san?": "",
  "You said you weren't interested in romance, but we still managed to hit it off really smooth.": "",
  "It even got to the point where we went out drinking. No investigations, no pretenses, just the two of us having a good time.": "",
  "And it looked like you were happy whenever we were together. I know I felt that way about you.": "",
  "You really want to know how I feel?": "",
  "I feel like heading to the office. My job might break my spirit sometimes, but at least it doesn't break my heart.": "",
  "...I see. Then I guess it's truly goodbye.": "",
  "...Yeah. I guess it is.": "",
  "Yukko...": "",
  "Are you sure you're okay with this, Nanami? Letting it end on such a sour note?": "",
  "You keep stuffing your emotions away and burying yourself in work in an attempt to block the rest of the world out...": "",
  "Didn't you tell me you were gonna make the next move when Yagami-san invited you out!?": "",
  "Are you sure you don't need to tell him what you felt back then!?": "",
  "You'll never change at this rate. I can see you becoming a bitter old lady, dragging her past around wherever she goes!": "",
  "Is that really how you want to end up!? Because good guys like Yagami-san don't come around very often, you know!": "",
  "...Fine.": "",
  "Yagami-san. There is one thing I need to communicate to you.": "",
  "Brace yourself!": "",
  "Oh my!": "",
  "Wh-What was that for?": "",
  "Do you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>really</font_kind> understand\njust how much you hurt me!?": "",
  "How they never even stop to\nconsider how we feel...": "",
  "If you really love me back,\nthen you need to prove it!": "",
  "Promise you'll be faithful...\nAnd don't ever lie to me again!": "",
  "You know, that actually hurt. More than any punch I've ever taken.": "",
  "...What, you want me to apologize or something?": "",
  "...Nah. I deserved that.": "",
  "So... where are we? Are you gonna be honest with me from now on?": "",
  "Of course. I promise not to keep anything between us.": "",
  "After all... we love each other, don't we?": "",
  "...Yeah. And I can see how sincere you are.": "",
  "But if you betray me again, you'll be getting much worse than a slap.": "",
  "Don't worry. I'll make sure that won't ever happen.": "",
  "Oooh... I'm so happy for you, Nanami...": "",
  "O-Oh, I'm sorry. I'll leave you two lovebirds alone... Enjoy. ❤": "",
  "Wow, Yukko... Guess she saved all the drama for the final act.": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san. I know we've been through a lot.": "",
  "And now... I want to start fresh.": "",
  "How about we just go by our first names?": "",
  "Sure. I think that's a good way to do it.": "",
  "All right, then...": "",
  "Heh, it's nice to be so open with one another... Right, Nanami?": "",
  "Mm. I think it sounds more natural to call each other like this.": "",
  "Sorry. But I don't think I can do that.": "",
  "Believe me... I really am flattered you like me. And as much as I want to return those feelings...": "",
  "As much as I want to be your boyfriend, and own up to everything I've said and done so far...": "",
  "I'm not in the position to do that right now.": "",
  "Wow... Now I feel really stupid. What have I been doing this whole time?": "",
  "Hey, what are you trying to say here!? What kind of cruel joke is this!?": "",
  "Well, it's like I said... I can't really be committed right now...": "",
  "You told me you loved Nanami! That's why I helped you out!": "",
  "Things have... changed a bit since then.": "",
  "So you were just toying with her emotions. And mine.": "",
  "Uh... please forgive me?": "",
  "Forgive you? How about <font_kind=yakuza_italic>fuck</font_kind> you!": "",
  "Yow!": "",
  "...Guess I deserved that too...": "",
  "Well... I'll be seeing you, Takayuki. Don't forget to message me, okay?": "",
  "(Taking responsibility, huh... I think I can handle that.)": "",
  "(I definitely won't be leading you on any more wild goose chases, that's for sure.)": "",
  "So this is where all the drone races take place...": "",
  "I'm gonna go ahead and sign up.": "",
  "Cool! I'll be rooting for you!": "",
  "All right. Let's win today!": "",
  "Just don't lose your cool out there.": "",
  "Wow, look at you! You actually got first!": "",
  "Haha, I guess you could say I'm... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>pretty fly</font_kind>.": "",
  "Tch. I was so close, too.": "",
  "That's okay, you still did really well!": "",
  "(I'll make sure to win next time...)": "",
  "What... happened out there? I was totally off my game.": "",
  "(Damn, that was really lame.)": "",
  "Have you ever been to the batting center?": "",
  "Actually, I've been here with my friends a few times. Are you a good hitter?": "",
  "I'd say I'm pretty decent.": "",
  "Well you certainly seem confident.": "",
  "(I'll make sure I live up to her expectations.)": "",
  "All right, bring on the slugfest! Let me at 'em!!": "",
  "(Time to show her what I'm really made of!)": "",
  "Guess it's just the two of us today, huh?": "",
  "Aww, are you lonely without Yukko making her usual racket?": "",
  "Haha, I wouldn't say that.": "",
  "Want to go against each other again?": "",
  "You bet I do.": "",
  "Awesome. Looks like I still got it.": "",
  "That really was awesome! I couldn't even dream of getting such a high score!": "",
  "(Heh. I'm glad I could actually impress her.)": "",
  "I guess I'll take it for what it is.": "",
  "Well, it's amazing compared to me.": "",
  "Huh? That's odd.": "",
  "Maybe you're feeling a little under the weather today...?": "",
  "(Damn. I'm looking like a total loser out here.)": "",
  "I haven't played darts in... Gosh, how long has it been?": "",
  "Are you any good?": "",
  "Hmm, I remember being pretty good.": "",
  "All right, then I expect a challenge.": "",
  "Challenge accepted.": "",
  "Want to play against each other again?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
